I am new to Candy Cane ice cream, my neighbours mentioned it the other month and that got me curious so......... here we are (Thanks Elana!!!)

It's soooo good i am gonna have to get more candy canes to make a bigger batch. 

It is a candy cane flavour ice cream, with candy cane pieces throughout (big and small). I love mint ice cream anyway and love this one too. 

So what will you need to make Candy Cane ice cream?

500g Milk @  2% fat
300g Cream @ 33% fat
90g Sugar
50g Dextrose
46g Skim Milk Powder
2g stabilizer
10g Peppermint extract
2 -3 x Candy Canes in the base
+
6x Candy Canes crushed up for the add in

